        <p>Developer NoShadow has officially slated <strong>Scavland</strong> for release into Steam Early Access on <strong>September 4, 2026</strong>. Following extensive playtest feedback and reaching over 100,000 Steam wishlists, the initial Early Access release will deliver the foundation of Zalesye's hardcore survival experience.</p>

